==Version history==
In [[Synthesis league]], synthesised items were created by sacrificing three fractured items to the [[Synthesiser]]. The type and number of synthesised implicit mods on the resulting item were influenced by the mods on the component items and the amount of fractured mods.

Between [[version 3.26.0]] and [[version 3.26.0c]] Hotfix 5, it was temporarily possible to use the "Reroll the Rarity of a non-Unique item" craft to create otherwise unobtainable versions of items, such as unique items with [[Synthesised]] implicit modifiers. These items were not deleted after the hotfix and are now [[legacy variant]] items that can only be obtained through [[trade]].

In [[version 3.29.0]], all direct sources of non-unique synthesised items were removed. They can now only be obtained by "bricking" synthesised unique items.

